7,‘Tring Tring – Marks of War’ pays tribute to late Naga vocalist Lamtsala...,https://www.morungexpress.com/tring-tring-marks-of-war-pays-tribute-to-late-naga-vocalist-lamtsala-sangtam,"Dimapur, December 13 (MExN): A new music video titled “Tring Tring – Marks of War”, performed by artist Azi Rudy, has been released as a heartfelt tribute to the late Lamtsala Sangtam, the iconic vocalist of the band Purple Fusion.","Naga, Sangtam",Sino-Tibetan
